# Card/token art is hosted on GitHub Releases (cube-art, cube-art-2), NOT in git.
# The JSON under public/Cube/*/json/ references the release URLs. Keeping the raw
# image binaries out of git avoids ~9.5GB of repo bloat and push-size limits.
public/Cube/**/*.jpg
public/Cube/**/*.jpeg
public/Cube/**/*.png
public/Cube/**/*.webp
public/Cube/**/*.gif
public/Cube/**/*.bmp

# Source scan PDFs that exceed GitHub's 100MB/file hard limit — kept local only.
public/Cube/Forth Batch/Set 4.pdf
public/Cube/Third Batch/all_images/set_3.pdf
# Scraped reference-art scratch (Instagram HTML/.download dumps) — not used by the site.
public/Cube/art/
public/Cube/Misc/
